<div id="u-credit-00218-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jdque" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6406351); return false;"><img class="small" src="https://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6406351&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609102763" alt="jdque" style="background-image:url(https://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6406351)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jdque" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6406351); return false;">jdque</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590409653 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">25 May 2020 12:27</span></p>
